{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let\u2019s tile again!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/b08ccbe6d0c0ecb9d1019a3d3f3b8b3e.avif?t=1761210246\" width=192 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just the tile shape has changed\u2049 Back again\u2014with almost nothing different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a single type of tile cover a plane non-periodically?<br>This long-unsolved mystery is known as the \u201cEinstein Problem,\u201d from the German <i>ein stein</i> meaning \u201cone stone.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2022, David Smith discovered the elusive einstein tile!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagination is infinite.<br>Freely tile the plane and create your own original background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.poster.avif?t=1761210246\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.webm?t=1761210246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/6131931d968595d68cd168feee2d652a.mp4?t=1761210246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the given frame using einstein tiles.<br>It\u2019s like a jigsaw puzzle\u2014with no picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893930/extras/4ec393b508c461e11b374765347be15c.poster.avif?t=1761210246\" width=160